    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e88bb9cca80c9095efe19f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "选拔赛结束后几天。为了填补那之后没能参观漏掉的东西，\n我连日收集着赛马娘们的情报。不过——",
      "source_fingerprint": "eacfb29bfba792c0f60f8f15ec0ef198d27ee508754c3b754330083a1e962616",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
