      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那天和自己一样错失机会的马娘，她的面容在脑海中挥之不去。\n罪恶感和后悔……这种失礼的感情也在脑中不断盘旋。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ebd0012c1b6b074e81f273f7dfa41f1826d50dadd2a9aadc7f7c304f0465304",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
